    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1282">

                <pb facs="0880" n="764" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg764"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/19.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul General Hanna.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-11-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 21, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your November 17 and November 18. Make earnest protest against attempt to extort
                    forced loans from American citizens. However, see Department’s October 24.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
